Task #9: /demo Statement section Podium-scale typography

Redesigned the "Business Statement" section on /demo to command the
screen with Podium-scale manifesto typography.

Changes to client/src/pages/DemoLanding.tsx (lines ~314-326):
- Section: Changed from py-20/py-28 padding to min-h-[85vh] with flex
  centering so the statement dominates the viewport as a standalone section
- H2 (first sentence): Scaled from text-3xl/4xl/5xl/6xl to
  text-5xl/6xl/7xl/8xl with tighter leading (1.08) and tracking-tight
  for bold, impactful display
- P (second sentence): Scaled from text-lg/xl to text-2xl/3xl/4xl with
  font-medium weight and leading-snug, creating clear hierarchy while
  remaining prominent (not body text)
- Container: Widened max-w from 3xl to 5xl for the section, and from
  2xl to 3xl for the paragraph, giving generous breathing room
- Spacing: Increased mb-6 to mb-8 on h2, mb-10 to mb-12 on p for
  better visual separation

No changes to other sections. CTA button preserved as-is.

